    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Mulliganed a 7-card hand that had 4 lands, a 4-drop creature (Inspiring Unicorn), a cantrip (Acrobatic Maneuver), and Flicker of Fate. While the hand is slow with no early plays and the flicker effects lack strong ETB targets, it's functional with guaranteed mana and a card-draw spell to find more action.",
      "action_taken": "Mulliganed to 6",
      "better_line": "Keep the 7-card hand. It has sufficient lands, a turn-4 play, and Acrobatic Maneuver to cycle into more threats. Going to 6 risks a worse hand for marginal improvement.",
